Deploy an app to this cluster:
  1. cub variant create <name> <base-space> --target scout-attach/target [--namespace <ns>]
  2. cub release publish <name>
Step 1 clones <base-space> into a deployment space bound to the cluster's
target and adds its Flux OCIRepository and Kustomization to the apps space
"scout-attach-flux-apps"; step 2 makes the deployment's config go live. Step 1 republishes
the apps space, and argobot deploys step 2's Release at once.
See "cub variant create --help".
